OL,3,ATeenage girl admits murder in row over
OL,4,Aboy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has admitted murdering a
OL,7,F16-year-old girl who she stabbed to
OL,8,Fdeath in a pre-planned fight over a
OL,9,Fboy.
OL,11,FLeeds Crown Court heard that Chloe
OL,12,FWatson Dransfield, 16, was taken by her
OL,13,Fboyfriend Blake Dowling, 18, to the
OL,14,Fhome of Kayla Smith, 18, who fatally
OL,15,Fstabbed her in the early hours of 28
OL,16,FMarch.
OL,18,FSmith had pleaded guilty to
OL,19,Fmanslaughter but denied murder. She
OL,20,Fthen changed her plea to guilty on the
OL,21,Fsecond day of her trial at Leeds Crown
OL,22,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
